/-!
# The Fefferman–Stein maximal inequality

This file was automatically generated by Codex.

The classical vector maximal theorem supplies the general mixed norm estimate in
blueprint `lem:vector-maximal`. The intended reusable statement covers all outer
and inner exponents greater than one and finite inner measure spaces.

The interpolation and scalar maximal foundations below are adapted from
`../lean-variationalsw/VariationalSW/Auto/MarcinkiewiczInterpolation.lean` and
`../lean-variationalsw/VariationalSW/Auto/HardyLittlewoodMaximal.lean`, originally
